              "tn_3_infantry"
            ]
          },
          "receiveLevies": false,
          "source": "OR I-II pp.898,470,472. Turney specifically ordered to report to Johnston; the June 30 return and arrival narrative identify the Third in that army. The roster can guide the request; the Third has no proved April-call identity. No State-pool lot is included."
        },
        {
