          "receiveLevies": false,
          "source": "OR I-LI.2 p.107, SO119, directs Bate to report to Ruggles at Fredericksburg; OR I-II pp.56,907 attest presence and the later Holmes assignment. [I] Address a request for the existing April-call lot to the modeled Fredericksburg command once its appointment and the call answer are received."
        }
